<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-notes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-notes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-notes.webp 946w" sizes="100vw" width="946" height="631" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Calculators</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for NH Owners</h1><p class="lede">Seven calculators and planners built from appraisal work. Check the insurer’s math, size your dispute and plan your deadlines — no sign-up, nothing stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="tool-grid" data-stagger><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/gap-and-fee-estimator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-notes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-notes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-notes.webp 946w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="946" height="631" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>Δ</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Dispute Size &amp; Net Recovery Estimator</h2><p>Size the disputed amount, test where an award might land and subtract appraiser and umpire fees.</p></span></a><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/depreciation-holdback-planner/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>ACV</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Planner</small><h2>Two-Check Holdback Planner</h2><p>List items with age and life to split a claim into the first ACV payment and the depreciation held back.</p></span></a><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/roof-squares-pitch-tool/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-close.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-close-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-close.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>▲</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Steep-Roof Squares Checker</h2><p>Turn a footprint and pitch into true roof squares, bundles and steep-roof flags to check an estimate.</p></span></a><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/percent-deductible-converter/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/gust-clouds.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/gust-clouds-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/gust-clouds.webp 996w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="996" height="664" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>%</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Percent-to-Dollars Deductible Tool</h2><p>Convert a percentage wind or named-storm deductible into dollars and compare it with a flat deductible.</p></span></a><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/nh-claim-deadline-calendar/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-shoveling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-shoveling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-shoveling.webp 1012w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="1012" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>◷</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Planner</small><h2>Granite State Claim Clock</h2><p>Map notice, proof of loss, depreciation and suit dates from your date of loss, then export them.</p></span></a><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/nh-appraisal-readiness-score/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/inspection-visit.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/inspection-visit-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/inspection-visit.webp 1021w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="1021" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>✓</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Checklist</small><h2>Claim File Readiness Gauge</h2><p>Twelve yes-or-no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p></span></a><a class="tc rv" href="/nh-claim-calculators/snow-weight-roof-calculator/"><span class="tc-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-chimney.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-chimney-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roof-chimney.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><i>❄</i></span><span class="tc-b"><small>Calculator</small><h2>Snow Weight Roof Calculator</h2><p>Estimate how much the snow and ice on your roof weighs, and compare it with a benchmark you enter.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tint"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>A sensible order for the calculators</h2><ol class="steps-plain"><li>Start with the <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/nh-claim-deadline-calendar/">deadline calendar</a> so nothing lapses.</li><li>Check the roof with the <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/roof-squares-pitch-tool/">roof squares &amp; pitch tool</a> — and, after a big winter, the <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/snow-weight-roof-calculator/">snow weight calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’re actually owed with the <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/percent-deductible-converter/">deductible converter</a> and <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/depreciation-holdback-planner/">holdback planner</a>.</li><li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/gap-and-fee-estimator/">gap &amp; fee estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/nh-claim-calculators/nh-appraisal-readiness-score/">readiness score</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">A free first look</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="big-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="/contact-nh-appraiser/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
</main>
